<title>USA: OHM Corp Q4 net per share rises to $0.14.</title>
<headline>OHM Corp Q4 net per share rises to $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>FINDLAY, Ohio 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.14		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net		 3,810		    2,099</p>
<p> Revs		144,572		  142,321</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  26,989		   26,701</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.43		    $0.30</p>
<p> Net		 11,515		   6,807</p>
<p> Revs		550,984		  457,925</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  26,844		   22,525</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1995 results include $3.9 million charge for Q2 acquisition costs. Excluding the charge, net revenue was $9.1 million, or $0.40 per share.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
